This is the safety/claims gate that TASK-005 deferred three times and TASK-004 (AP19/AP20) routed here — the method for rating a candidate health micro-action on **safety** and **general-benefit evidence**, then binding each rating to the exact language the product may use. Its core job: let HerRays recommend real health actions **without ever implying personal disease-risk reduction** (CLAUDE.md §3).

